	"panels": [
		{
			"id": 1,
			"title": "Codex / Tibo — 残量・回復見通し",
			"type": "text",
			"description": "",
			"gridPos": {
				"x": 0,
				"y": 0,
				"w": 24,
				"h": 3
			},
			"datasource": {
				"type": "loki",
				"uid": "loki"
			},
			"targets": [],
			"fieldConfig": {
				"defaults": {
					"unit": "none",
					"noValue": "不明",
					"decimals": 1,
					"color": {
						"mode": "palette-classic"
					}
				},
				"overrides": []
			},
			"options": {
				"mode": "markdown",
				"content": "5分ごとに複数アカウントを監視。**提案のみ：自動切替なし**。現在値は15分以内の観測。消費速度・継続時間は履歴不足なら「不明」。Tibo予測は未校正で、通常回復・実際の残量とは別の情報です。\n\n破線の注釈：Tibo monitorが通知した時刻（全アカウントの回復確定時刻ではありません）。[予測元](https://nextreset.ai/forecast/) · [公表・観測元](https://codex-resets.com/) · [リセット権の使用履歴](/d/codex-reset-history)"
			}
		},
		{
			"id": 2,
			"title": "監視が最後に成功した時刻",
			"type": "stat",
			"description": "",
			"gridPos": {
				"x": 0,
				"y": 3,
				"w": 8,
				"h": 4
			},
			"datasource": {
				"type": "loki",
				"uid": "loki"
			},
			"targets": [
				{
					"refId": "A",
					"expr": "last_over_time({job=\"codex-usage-advisor\"} | json | event=\"advisor_status\" | observed_at!=\"\"  | unwrap observed_at | __error__=\"\" [15m]) by (host) * 1000",
					"datasource": {
						"type": "loki",
						"uid": "loki"
					},
					"queryType": "instant",
					"legendFormat": "{{host}}",
					"editorMode": "code"
				}
			],
			"fieldConfig": {
				"defaults": {
					"unit": "dateTimeAsIso",
					"noValue": "不明",
					"decimals": 1,
					"color": {
						"mode": "palette-classic"
					}
				},
				"overrides": []
			},
			"options": {
				"reduceOptions": {
					"calcs": ["last"],
					"fields": "",
					"values": false
				},
				"textMode": "value_and_name",
				"colorMode": "value",
				"graphMode": "none"
			}
		},
